COMMENT ON TABLE public.moodboard_theme_templates IS
  'Curated starter "Overall Theme" gallery for the Mood Board (2026-09-03), 100 rows across 5 style_family values x a mix of 6 mood_tag values. Applying a template (applyMoodboardTemplate) fills only EMPTY palette roles / reception zones / inspiration slots / theme name+description on the couple''s own event — never overwrites anything already set. style_family reuses moodboard_library_assets.style_theme''s 5-value vocabulary so template application can look up matching figure_attire assets for inspiration-slot suggestions; mood_tag is an independent second filter axis for the gallery UI.';
